- Should I preserve devices and avoid deleting anything? Any special steps I should take (e.g., turn off auto-delete, disable account cleanup)?

4. Discovery & evidence gathering
- What discovery tools will we likely use first (document requests, interrogatories, subpoenas for third-party records, depositions)?
