- Don’t attempt to coach or alter witness statements. Tell potential witnesses to speak truthfully and refer them to Maria for questions.
- Avoid communicating about the case with your ex-spouse or on public platforms.
- Preserve privacy/security when sharing documents — prefer secure portals or encrypted transfers if available.
- Ask Maria before issuing subpoenas or contacting third parties; subpoena procedures and service differ by county/state.
- If you suspect spoliation, tell Maria immediately — she may need to take swift action.

