Please let me know a good time for a 20–30 minute call. Also tell me anything you want me to stop doing now (e.g., posting on social media) and any specific preservation steps you want taken immediately.

Thanks,
[Your name] / [phone]

6) Final recommendations / next steps
- Call or email Maria now to confirm the hearing date and immediate deadlines — that determines how much you need to accelerate gathering evidence.
- Preserve all evidence; do not delete anything.
- Prepare the one-page timeline + the two-page memo and send to Maria ahead of a call.
