  - Should we seek any interim relief (temporary injunction, stay, protective order, or emergency relief)?
  - Do you recommend any immediate motions (motion to dismiss, motion to stay, motion for extension) before filing an answer?

- Settlement and costs
  - What are the realistic settlement options and risks? Should we attempt settlement or mediation before heavy discovery?
  - What are estimated costs/time to prepare for trial vs. to pursue settlement?

- Practical/administrative
  - How will we communicate and share documents (secure portal, encrypted email, file-sharing)?
  - What do you need from me right away and in what format?
  - Who on your team will handle which tasks and what are expected turnaround times?
  - Are there confidentiality concerns given the opposing party is my ex‑spouse (protective order, sealing records, privacy)?

