Practical timeline & next steps for you now
- Today: preserve evidence; compile timeline and index; gather critical documents.
- Within 48–72 hours: send the materials to Maria and request a short meeting; ask whether she recommends subpoenas or depositions now.
- Before the hearing: obtain witness statements/affidavits if feasible; ask for a continuance if important evidence cannot be obtained in time.
- Ask Maria to confirm all local filing/service deadlines (Maricopa County civil rules) and whether any filings are required by you personally.

