- Make a list of potential witnesses with contact info and a brief note on what each knows.
Don’t:
- Delete or alter any emails, texts, documents, or devices. Avoid factory-resetting or selling/disposing of devices.
- Discuss the case on social media or with the opposing party (except through counsel).
- Share privileged communications with third parties (unless instructed by counsel).

